# Place your .pbix and .rdl report files here
#
# Example structure:
#   reports/
#   ├── sales-dashboard.pbix
#   ├── monthly-summary.pbix
#   ├── inventory-report.rdl
#   └── financial-statement.rdl
#
# Note: PBIX files are binary and will be tracked but not diffed.
#       RDL files are XML and can be reviewed in pull requests.
